    buf_str(out, c"std-text 4150876483\nstd-units 1 2283225 6037 7338 492 19\ncount_ones effects diverge crate x u64 i64 leading_zeros trailing_zeros contract_check panic ok bool site check a\nb c main_error io E fmt Debug e i32 eprintln ARCH_FEATURES sync atomic AtomicU64 new arch_bit\narch_store found a64 w arch_consistent arch_disabled store Ordering Relaxed pairs out k arch_same u8 len i\nname s env __sys environ usize p add is_null n entry slice from_raw_parts j arch_named a64_names\nx86_names on_a64 link_name arch_sysctlbyname old newlen arch_sysctl value u32 r as_mut_ptr ptr null arch_init_macos known names\ntests all arch_word_macos load arch_getauxval kind arch_init_linux cap cap2 arch_word_linux arch_cpuid leaf sub arch_xgetbv index arch_init_x86\nmax c1 d1 reg ymm b7 arch_word_x86 COVERAGE_MAP Copy builtin_impls i8 i16 isize u16 f32 f64\nClone char PhantomData T Sized inline clone self Deref Target deref Self DerefMut deref_mut Index Idx\nOutput IndexMut index_mut Drop drop Add Rhs rhs Sub Mul mul Div div Rem rem Neg\nneg Not not BitAnd bitand BitOr bitor BitXor bitxor Shl shl Shr shr AddAssign add_assign SubAssign\nsub_assign MulAssign mul_assign DivAssign div_assign RemAssign rem_assign BitAndAssign bitand_assign BitOrAssign bitor_assign BitXorAssign bitxor_assign ShlAssign shl_assign ShrAssign\nshr_assign Range derive PartialEq Eq Hash start end PartialOrd contains U item is_empty RangeInclusive exhausted into_inner\nRangeFrom RangeTo RangeToInclusive RangeFull Bound Included Excluded Unbounded RangeBounds start_bound end_bound f Formatter Result write_str result\nOk pure eq other ne Ord Less Equal Greater is_eq _ is_ne is_lt is_gt is_le is_ge\nreverse then then_with F FnOnce partial_cmp Option lt Some le gt ge cmp min clamp min_by_key\nK FnMut max_by_key Reverse Default A B C D clone_from source default DefaultIn default_in From from\nInto into TryFrom Error try_from TryInto try_into AsRef as_ref AsMut as_mut Infallible TryFromIntError str IntErrorKin